Source-data notice

The repository does not relicense upstream Korean government source records.
The three v1 Public Data Portal API pages were rechecked on 2026-09-08 and each
displayed `이용허락범위 제한 없음` (no restriction on the permitted-use scope).

The public v1 dataset release is limited to the independently verified,
privacy-minimized aggregate identified in `provenance/v1_release_scope.json`.
Kaggle metadata uses the `other` license category and the dataset description
points back to the official source pages and their displayed terms. Row-level
PERMIT records and precise coordinates are not released by this project.

The software/code license is not granted by this notice and remains a separate
repository-maintainer decision.
